  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758898,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1.000 Miles: A Commodore 64 Adventure\n\nEmbark on a perilous journey across the vast American frontier in *1.000 Miles*, a thrilling action-adventure game for the Commodore 64. You are a lone rider, tasked with delivering a vital message across a thousand miles of treacherous terrain, from St. Louis to Los Angeles. \n\nThe game combines elements of driving, shooting, and resource management. Navigate challenging landscapes – deserts, mountains, and plains – while battling hostile Native Americans, ruthless bandits, and dangerous wildlife. Manage your horse's stamina, ammunition, and supplies carefully, as scarcity is a constant threat. \n\n*1.000 Miles* features a dynamic day/night cycle that impacts visibility and enemy behavior. Discover hidden locations, uncover valuable resources, and upgrade your equipment to survive the harsh realities of the Wild West.  Success depends on your skill, strategy, and a little bit of luck as you race against time and the elements to complete your mission.  A true test of endurance and frontier survival!"
    },
